From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chinohana <chinohana@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] service: make root trampoline read-only before load

Android 14 and newer reject writable DEX/JAR files.  RootService writes
main.jar into the app cache and immediately asks app_process to load it,
which aborts with a SecurityException.

Delete the previous trampoline before recreating it, then remove every
write bit after the stream is closed and before app_process starts.
RootServiceManager runs this launch path on the main thread, so no
consumer can observe the file between these operations.

Give the locally published modules a distinct version so the manager
cannot accidentally resolve the unpatched JitPack artifact.
---
 build.gradle.kts                                                   | 4 ++++
 .../topjohnwu/superuser/internal/RootServiceManager.java           | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build.gradle.kts b/build.gradle.kts
index 9ae9b3a..0000000 100644
--- a/build.gradle.kts
+++ b/build.gradle.kts
@@ -8,6 +8,10 @@ plugins {
     id("com.android.library") version "8.5.0" apply false
 }
 
+allprojects {
+    version = "6.0.0-owner-readonly"
+}
+
 val dlPackageList by tasks.registering {
     outputs.upToDateWhen { false }
     doLast {
diff --git a/service/src/main/java/com/topjohnwu/superuser/internal/RootServiceManager.java b/service/src/main/java/com/topjohnwu/superuser/internal/RootServiceManager.java
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/service/src/main/java/com/topjohnwu/superuser/internal/RootServiceManager.java
+++ b/service/src/main/java/com/topjohnwu/superuser/internal/RootServiceManager.java
@@ -168,11 +168,18 @@ public class RootServiceManager implements Handler.Callback {
 
             Context ctx = Utils.getDeContext();
             File mainJar = new File(ctx.getCacheDir(), "main.jar");
+            if (mainJar.exists() && !mainJar.delete()) {
+                throw new IllegalStateException("Cannot replace stale root trampoline");
+            }
 
             // Dump main.jar as trampoline
             try (InputStream in = ctx.getResources().getAssets().open("main.jar");
                  OutputStream out = new FileOutputStream(mainJar)) {
                 Utils.pump(in, out);
             }
+            if (!mainJar.setReadOnly()) {
+                mainJar.delete();
+                throw new IllegalStateException("Cannot make root trampoline read-only");
+            }
 
             String env = "";
             String params = "";
-- 
2.53.0.windows.2
